==Swedish==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
The adjective is attested since 1637, from the [[plural]] [[dative]] form of {{m|sv|lag||law}}. The adverb is attested since 1675.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlɑːˌɡɔm/|lang=sv}} {{audio|sv-lagom.ogg|Audio|lang=sv}}

===Adverb===
{{sv-adv|mermest}}

# (just) right, [[fitting]], neither too much nor too little
#: ''Soppan är '''lagom''' saltad.''
#:: "The soup is salted just right."

===Adjective===
{{head|sv|adjective}}

# (just) right, [[fitting]], neither too much nor too little
#: ''Den här lägenheten är precis '''lagom''' stor för min dotter.''
#:: "This apartment is just the right size for my daughter."

====Derived terms====
* {{l|sv|lagom är bäst}}